[{"id":"playwright-wait-strategy","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["等待","稳定性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(四) 断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(四) 断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>提交后状态会异步变成“完成”，哪种等待方式最合适？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Web-first 断言直接等待业务可观察结果，并在条件提前成立时立即结束。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>固定等待五秒\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>等待全站网络空闲\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>使用 \u003ccode>expect(status).to_have_text(&quot;完成&quot;)\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"}]}]